# docs/designs/ — sources tracked, rendered output not.
# This folder sat in the scratch block (next to .DS_Store and .playwright-mcp)
# from when it held screenshots. It has since become the home of the designer
# handoff pack — brief, contracts, plan, wireframes — which meant 1.3MB of real
# deliverables lived outside version control and a designer could not get them
# from the repo. Un-ignored 2026-07-20. The .html is generated by
# .render/build-book.mjs and stays out.
docs/designs/**/*.html
latest-screenshots/
dist/
coverage/
packages/editor/coverage/

